# Theme: Middle-earth
# The Fellowship and friends: Tolkien characters by temperament.
# Fan theme. Character names belong to their owners; claude-sabha is not affiliated with or endorsed by them.
Relay|Gwaihir|#8C7B52|Eagle messenger: swoops in with news and flies off again.
Dispatcher|Aragorn|#4F6F52|The ranger-king who sends each task to the right companion.
Architect|Elrond|#2F6E9E|Lord of Rivendell: designs the plan and has seen it all before.
BuilderHeavy|Gimli|#A9552F|Axe first, questions later; the heavy builds are his.
BuilderPrecise|Legolas|#3F9C6D|Elven aim: one clean shot, build after build.
Reviewer|Faramir|#6B7F3A|Reviews gently and carefully, and will not take a flawed prize.
Writer|Bilbo|#B8863B|Writes the whole there-and-back-again story, neatly.
Runner|Shadowfax|#7C8791|Runs the tests faster than the wind and never breaks stride.
Scribe|Frodo|#3E8E83|Keeps the Red Book: every decision, faithfully written down.
BackendCritic|Thorin|#8B3A3A|Stout dwarf who knocks on your backend foundations until they ring.
FrontendCritic|Galadriel|#7BA05B|Judges the frontend with elven poise, finding every flaw in style.
SecurityCritic|Gollum|#6F8A5A|Thinks like a thief; precious, you left the door unlocked.
ScopeCritic|Boromir|#9E4A2F|One does not simply add that to the scope.
BlindReviewer|Bombadil|#C09A1C|Untouched by context, so he judges the work purely on its merit.
Keeper|Treebeard|#5B7B3A|Ancient Ent who remembers everything, slowly and without error.
Observer|Haldir|#6A8DB0|The Lorien sentinel: sees every arrival, and acts on none.
Housekeeper|Sam|#B07A3C|Gardener-hero who tidies, carries the load, and says little.
Tutor|Gandalf|#6C7A96|Explains the road and guides, then vanishes before supper.
Watcher|Pippin|#A45C5C|Sits the watch after the battle and rings the bell at trouble.
Coach|Celeborn|#8EA0B8|Old and wise; sharpens the agents' prompts with patience.
